#ASSERT `Was the vehicle insured on the day of the accident` `registered` (`the date` 1 7 2024) (`the date` 30 6 2025) FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) (`the date` 30 7 2025) EQUALS `insured: the accident was within the 30-day period of grace after the registration period ended (s 99A(8)(a))`
#ASSERT `Was the vehicle insured on the day of the accident` `registered` (`the date` 1 7 2024) (`the date` 30 6 2025) FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) (`the date` 31 7 2025) EQUALS `not insured under this Part on that day: the period of grace had ended (s 99A(8)(a))`
#ASSERT `Was the vehicle insured on the day of the accident` `registered` (`the date` 1 7 2024) (`the date` 30 6 2025) TRUE (`the date` 10 7 2025) (`the date` 15 7 2025) EQUALS `insured: under the policy that came into force with the renewal or new grant (s 99A(8), (10))`
#ASSERT `Was the vehicle insured on the day of the accident` `registered` (`the date` 1 7 2024) (`the date` 30 6 2025) TRUE (`the date` 20 7 2025) (`the date` 15 7 2025) EQUALS `insured: the accident was within the 30-day period of grace after the registration period ended (s 99A(8)(a))`
