#ASSERT `By when must I give my notice of claim` (`the date` 31 8 2023) `driving` FALSE `a road car` TRUE `SA policy` FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `within 6 months after the accident: on or before` (`the date` 29 2 2024)
#ASSERT `By when must I give my notice of claim` (`the date` 15 3 2024) `driving` FALSE `a road car` TRUE `SA policy` FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `within 6 months after the accident: on or before` (`the date` 15 9 2024)
#ASSERT `By when must I give my notice of claim` (`the date` 15 3 2024) `driving` FALSE `a road car` TRUE `SA policy` TRUE (`the date` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `within 6 months after the accident: on or before` (`the date` 15 9 2024)
