§§ `s 126A(2), regs 5, 6: what the notice includes`

#ASSERT `What must my notice of claim include` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS LIST `the notice in the manner and form the Minister approves (s 126A(2)(b))`, `a statement setting out details of the claim (s 126A(2)(c)(i))`, `a medical practitioner's certificate or opinion of the nature and probable cause of the death or injury, in the form the CTP Regulator determines (s 126A(2)(c)(ii), reg 5(1))`, `the police report number of any report made to a police officer under the Road Traffic Act 1961 about the accident (s 126A(2)(c)(iii))`, `evidence of income or earning capacity, such as payslips, PAYG payment summaries or income tax returns (reg 5(2)(a))`, `the claimant's driver's licence number (reg 5(2)(d))`, `a statement in the CTP Regulator's form authorising access to records and other information relevant to the claim (s 126A(2)(d), reg 6)`
#ASSERT `What must my notice of claim include` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS LIST `the notice in the manner and form the Minister approves (s 126A(2)(b))`, `a statement setting out details of the claim (s 126A(2)(c)(i))`, `a medical practitioner's certificate or opinion of the nature and probable cause of the death or injury, in the form the CTP Regulator determines (s 126A(2)(c)(ii), reg 5(1))`, `proof of the claimant's identity (reg 5(2)(e))`, `a statement in the CTP Regulator's form authorising access to records and other information relevant to the claim (s 126A(2)(d), reg 6)`
#ASSERT `What must my notice of claim include` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS LIST `the notice in the manner and form the Minister approves (s 126A(2)(b))`, `a statement setting out details of the claim (s 126A(2)(c)(i))`, `a medical practitioner's certificate or opinion of the nature and probable cause of the death or injury, in the form the CTP Regulator determines (s 126A(2)(c)(ii), reg 5(1))`, `evidence of medical expenses incurred up to the date of the claim, such as accounts or receipts (reg 5(2)(b))`, `the certificate of death (reg 5(2)(c))`, `proof of the claimant's identity (reg 5(2)(e))`, `a statement in the CTP Regulator's form authorising access to records and other information relevant to the claim (s 126A(2)(d), reg 6)`

